{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015184022714-1015_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261015184022\"/><p>今日(15日)中午12時44分，執法部門接獲途人報案，指發現一名老婦倒臥於天水圍天秀路15號對開，懷疑她從高處墮下。救援人員奉召趕至，惜事主已經返魂乏術。警員經初步調查後，相信姓黃(79歲)事主從上址天台墮下，現場沒有檢獲遺書，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T11:00:12.693881+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:40:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:58:02.346383+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T10:58:14.744119+00:00","content_hash":"a40fa8bd55b19d01f65bccb12557d5f76ed5b0d7a67bd46a84f63e19b0321fc8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}